      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The silence is not empty; it is full of the weight of every life that was never lived. You are not waiting for the air to run out, but for the last ember of your own self to finally extinguish. There is no point in fighting ghosts or protecting people when the only thing left to protect is the quiet you have built.",
